Package: nestedtune
Title: Nested Cross-Validation for Tidymodels
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Jeffrey", "Girard", , "jeffgirard@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Builds and orchestrates nested cross-validation designs for the
    tidymodels ecosystem. Provides a memory-lean nested resampling
    constructor whose object size does not grow with the outer fold count,
    producing splits identical to those of 'rsample'.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 8.0.0
URL: https://github.com/jmgirard/nestedtune,
    https://jmgirard.github.io/nestedtune/
BugReports: https://github.com/jmgirard/nestedtune/issues
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    cli,
    rlang,
    rsample
Suggests:
    lobstr,
    mlbench,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
